+themselves invalidate Track A, but they make a theorem-only hardness claim
+untenable.  The claimed distribution is therefore tested directly.  The
+parameter k equals n and grows at every main rung, avoiding any suggestion that a
+small parameter is hard merely because the problem is W[P]-complete.
+
