+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Section 3.4 Lemma 10 and Section 3 Corollary 12 establish "
+        "W[P]-hardness/completeness parameterized by selected-set size; shipping "
+        "uses k=n growing with n in a quiet-planted, near-threshold 3-CNF regime "
